 ],
 "footerTitle": "Method & sources",
 "footerHtml": "<p>Spending is current health expenditure per capita, PPP (WHO GHED via World Bank); life expectancy from UN WPP 2024; via Our World in Data, CC BY 4.0. The fitted curve is an OLS fit of life expectancy on ln(spending), computed in the browser on 2022 data. The Central African Republic is excluded (implausible UN values). Missing values are shown as missing.</p>"
}